---
title: Chocolate Pudding
portions: 6
category: Dessert
source: "French family classic"
---

## Cooking

[Heat] Pour the @milk{500 ml} into a #saucepan{} and warm over ^{low heat}.

[Thicken] Whisk the @flour{50 g} into the @milk{} until smooth.

[Cocoa] Add the @cocoa{3 tbsp} and the @sugar{3 tbsp} together, whisking constantly over low heat.

[Simmer] Keep whisking until the first bubble — the mixture thickens quickly.

[Serve] Pour into #ramekins{} and let cool to set.
